From 15c418dd2bf169e9e65e3bfca2dc70ebbbac21f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Le Minh Triet <noreply@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:57:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(task): add caller-declared tracking and dispatch
 provenance

- Record task_dispatch_v1 in parent and task_dispatch_child_v1 in child session.
- Add optional tracking field to task items and types.
- Document tracking wire field.
