 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Added optional `tracking` to `task` items: declare `project_id`, `task_id`, and `attempt_id` to have each spawn record a runtime-issued `dispatch_id` in the parent session and a matching child-session link, so a child session joins to exactly one declared dispatch.
+
